# IIgs ROM 4 "Mark Twain" personality (apple2gs4): Apple ROM binaries are NOT
# redistributed in this fork — fetch them per assets/roms/apple2gs4/roms.json
# (Asimov / Apple II Documentation Project mirror). The roms.json manifest IS tracked.
assets/roms/apple2gs4/main.rom
assets/roms/apple2gs4/char.rom
assets/roms/apple2gs3/main.rom
assets/roms/apple2gs3/char.rom
# Apple ROM/character binaries are never redistributed (fetch from Asimov per roms.json)
roms/apple2gs/*.rom

